    "updated_at": "2026-09-22T12:32:28Z",
    "body": "One last note:\nI think it is unfortunate changing the `label` attribute behavior depending if is used on `<option>` or `<optgroup>`,\nand changing its behavior for `appearance: auto` platform pickers so late.\n```html\n<optgroup label=\"group-label\">\n  <legend>legend-content</legend>\n  <option label=\"label-option\">option</option>\n</optgroup>\n```\nPer current spec I think this render:\n```\nlegend-content\n  option-label\n```\nwhile every stable browser(Safari IOS, Chrome desktop/Android, Firefox desktop/Android) I tested render:\n```\ngroup-label\n  option-label\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
